<newsitem itemid="89504" id="root" date="1996-10-01" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: House of Fraser H1 loss widens, but div held.</title>
<headline>House of Fraser H1 loss widens, but div held.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 27</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.3 loss	     vs 1.3 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.7		    vs same</p>
<p>Pretax after exceptional charge</p>
<p>				13.6 loss	    vs 4.3 loss</p>
<p> Exceptional charge     4.9		    vs nil</p>
<p> Turnover		   334.7		  vs 322.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts were for a pre-tax loss of between 3.0 to 7.0 million stg. Per share figures include exceptional items.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 4.3 loss	     vs 0.5 loss</p>
<p> Interest		   4.4 debit	    vs 3.8 debit</p>
<p> Tax			  3.7		    vs 1.3</p>
<p> Net taxed		  9.9		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 2</p>
<p>Div registration date  Oct 15  Ex-div date		n/a</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
